// Modules in the editor (§9.1);
// 
// Visible in place - its module, modules of its direct use (non-transitive) and prelude: guidance,
// transition and addition know the functions of use geo.vec.
// program: 95_modules.vish
open_view module
// guidance: selected in instance - module function
hover 1 @norm2:2
// expect: kind="объявление" text="norm2(v2 a)  — выбрана здесь, модуль geo.vec"
// expect: kind="объявление" text="norm2(i64 n)"
// F12: overload from the module is - "Add norm2(v2)" is not necessary
pointer 1 @norm2:2 0 1
key 1 F12
// expect: items=⏎  name="norm2(v2 a)" kind="перегрузка" detail="выбрана здесь, модуль geo.vec"⏎  name="norm2(i64 n)" kind="перегрузка" detail=""
// expect-not: добавить
// Enter - Module function in the second panel
key 1 Enter
// expect: kind="fn"
// expect: текст:⏎norm2(v2 a) => dot(a, a);
key 2 Escape
// Module names are closer to prelude
pointer 1 @print:1 0 0
key 1 s
key 1 c
// expect: items=⏎  name="scale" kind="функция" detail="(a, k), модуль geo.vec"
